This license (MIT) covers the code in this repository only — the server,
scripts, tooling, and any client libraries. The dataset itself (episode-level
filler/canon records) is licensed separately under CC BY-NC-SA 4.0, with a
commercial-use carve-out — see DATA_LICENSE for the full text. This split
mirrors the precedent set by manami-project/anime-offline-database, one of
this project's own seed data sources, which uses the same code/data license
split; the data side moved from an earlier ODbL v1.0 choice to CC BY-NC-SA
4.0 on 2026-08-20 (see CLAUDE.md's Decisions Made — License for the
reasoning) — this file previously still referenced ODbL, which had gone
stale.
